$Button=ok,Tell,compleate
$Timeout=20,tell,alivestill
$Timeout=25,tell,almost
$Timeout=30,tell,


[A.]
<h2>Invasion</h2>
<i>"It's not retreating..I'd like to call it advancing to the rear. "<br>
--Unknown Nimbian General </i>  
<p>While preparing to launch a major assault to end this bloody confict you are attack!!  Many of your fronts have collasped and your allies are retreating deeper into your territory.  You are one of last points on the front lines that have yet to fall.  You must hold them off long enough for your allies to regroup and attack.  Before there arrival you must do as much damage to their defences and perhaps kill one of their priests....

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron92

[compleate]
<p>
In the distance you see several islands....the help has arrived....

$Timeout=5,tell,m0

[m0]
<h2>Message from the Page of Thunder</h2>
<p>
Hey need some help?

$Timeout=4,tell,m1

[m1]
<h2>Message from Knight of Wind</h2>
<p>
Yup.
$Timeout=2,tell,m2

[m2]
<h2>Message from Duke of Thunder</h2>
<p>
About time you got here.

$Timeout=4,tell,m3

[m3]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
Talk about being grateful...

$Timeout=4,tell,m4

[m4]
<h2>Message from the Govener of Sun</h2>
<p>
Yeah I know, these hotshots are practicly begging for help.

$Timeout=6,tell,m5

[m5]
<h2>Message from the Squire of Rain</h2>
<p>
Enough of this chit chat..let's thrash these guys!!

$Timeout=5,tell,m6

[m6]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
You have held off the invaders long enough for re-enforcements to arrive!  With your combined forces the attackers were destroyed.  However all the remaining clans of Nimbus decided to duke it out right on your front doorstep.  You and your allies decided to wade into the carnage and pick their fights.  You are confident that they will do well.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron2


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>
In a blaze of glory you manage to defeat the invaders without any help from the arriving re-enforcements!  Now the final battle approaches.
<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron2


